flowchart LR
  U[User / Browser] --> UI[React SPA: Dashboard, Forms, Results]
  UI --> VAL[Client-side validation]
  VAL -->|valid ClaimData| SCORE[Local heuristic service]
  SCORE --> BASE[Baseline PredictionResult]
  BASE --> KEY{Gemini key configured?}
  KEY -->|No| VIEW[Result UI]
  KEY -->|Yes| SDK[Google GenAI SDK in browser]
  SDK --> API[Google Gemini API: gemini-2.5-flash]
  API --> PARSE[Parse structured response]
  PARSE -->|valid| ENRICH[Attach geminiAnalysis]
  PARSE -->|failure or null| VIEW
  ENRICH --> VIEW
  VIEW --> CHAT[Optional Copilot requests]
  CHAT --> SDK
  LS[(Browser localStorage: Gemini API key only)] -. lookup and save .-> KEY
  NOTE[No app backend, claims database, or authentication] --- UI
